      collection_cat4_prod6_desc: "",
      collection_cat4_prod6_title: "",
      collection_cat4_story_p1: "Rare objects of art — sourced from grand homes and families with deep roots in Greek tradition, creations inspired by the eras of Art Deco, Baroque and Rococo — are gathered to revive the timeless value of yesterday within today.",
      collection_cat4_story_p2: "Through the contemporary soul of Nostalgia The Collection, they regain form and light. They are dressed in scents inspired by other eras and wrapped in memories, transforming each creation into a precious nostalgic glow that bridges the gulf between past and present.",
      collection_cat4_story_title: "Timeless Artifacts Reborn in Light, Scent & Memory",
      collection_cat5: "NI Terra",
      collection_cat5_story_p1: "An excerpt from a memory older than time.\\n\\n“Then came the moment when pages were no longer paper, but portals.\\n\\nWords were not read—\\nthey were revealed.\\n\\nAnd whoever sought answers did not find them in people, but in the signs that Light left upon their path.\\n\\nThen appeared the circles of the Sun, the solar tales of solstices, ancient cosmogonies, and those memories that remain alive beneath layers of centuries.\\n\\nFor the subconscious records what the mind is slow to understand.\\n\\nAnd Ether whispers truths not meant for everyone.\\n\\nOnly those who cultivated their soul deeply can recognize its traces.\\n\\nOnly they can discern the sign when it emerges through Air.\\n\\nAnd when the Eagle’s wingbeat arrives, it is not heard as sound—it is recognized as destiny.\\n\\nIt cleaves sky and time.\\n\\nIt carries memories, births, losses, and rebirths.\\n\\nIt reminds us that nothing is lost.\\n\\nThat everything returns to the cycle from which it was born.\\n\\nAnd then Phos is revealed.\\n\\nNot as light that illuminates the world, but as light that awakens the soul.\\n\\nAnd the flame becomes memory.\\n\\nAnd memory becomes knowledge.\\n\\nAnd knowledge becomes a path.”",
      collection_cat5_story_title: "NI TERRA · ANCIENT NOSTALGIA",
